---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy — Rooted Community"
  description="How Rooted Community handles personal information collected through this website."
>
  <section class="container section">
    <p class="eyebrow">Statement</p>
    <h1 class="page-title">Privacy</h1>
  </section>

  <section class="container section">
    <div class="prose">
      <p>
        Rooted Community collects only the information you choose to share with us — typically through
        an email or a referral form linked from this site. We don't sell or share personal information
        with third parties for marketing purposes.
      </p>

      <h2>What this site collects</h2>
      <p>
        This site is a static site hosted on GitHub Pages. We don't run our own servers and we don't
        collect form submissions through this domain.
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <strong>Server logs</strong> are kept by our hosting provider (GitHub Pages) for the purpose
          of operating the site. They include IP addresses and request paths and are not shared with
          us in identifiable form.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Analytics</strong>: if enabled, we use Google Analytics 4 with anonymized IP and no
          advertising features. You can opt out by enabling Do Not Track or by using a browser
          extension that blocks analytics scripts.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Email</strong>: messages you send to a Rooted Community email address are stored in
          our Google Workspace inbox and visible only to staff.
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Program participants</h2>
      <p>
        Information shared by program participants — through intake, peer support, or community
        circles — is held in strict confidence by program staff. Program records are not collected
        through this website.
      </p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>
        Questions about how we handle information should go to the
        <a href="/contact/">contact page</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .page-title {
    font-size: clamp( 2.75rem, 6vw, 5rem );
    line-height: 1.05;
    letter-spacing: -0.018em;
    margin-top: var( --space-3 );
  }
</style>
